        "@value": "Draft. Assigns an lu:colour to every class (80 classes had none in 0.4.0) and revises 20 existing colours so that each secondary owns one hue, tertiaries form a lightness ladder within it, and true blue is left free for the water attribute. No codes, labels or definitions change."
